        {
          "group_id": "loop_filter_XC1",
          "kind": "capacitor",
          "count": 1,
          "attempted": false,
          "ok": false,
          "reason": "SG13CMOS5L has no MIM capacitor at all (its plate layers are on cmos5l's own DRC/LVS forbidden-layer lists), so this design's MIM->MoM swap (DR-004 / issue #22) lands on cap_cmomi -- and neither half of the tooling covers it: every klt gen generator rejects the ihp-sg13cmos5l PDK family outright (klayout-tools#1462, filed by issue #24's pass), and the curated sg13cmos5l extraction deck's EXTRACTION_DECK.capacitors is empty, so a hand-drawn MoM capacitor would extract as no device at all (klayout-tools#1463, also filed by that pass). Recorded here, never drawn, never silently dropped"
        },
        {
          "group_id": "loop_filter_XC2",
